{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793463907438,"sessionID":"ses_e6d3ce8c9ffeJ1xzKXDoULu3JY","part":{"partID":"prt_192c76c43001SwRQXi7eeOTISo","sessionID":"ses_e6d3ce8c9ffeJ1xzKXDoULu3JY","messageID":"msg_192c76656001apd3U2hhKIQQCL","type":"tool","id":"call_01a192c76ae17220be1da3c251bf4b62","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"/// Host-visible party code panel (D-pad settings overlay page).\n///\n/// Shows the party/channel session scope as text plus exactly one QR\n/// encoding the authoritative anonymous session payload (opaque identifiers\n/// only — never URLs, device ids, or secrets), and the joined guest device\n/// list. The TV's own device id is NEVER rendered here: it authorizes the\n/// host-only `listPartyDevices` request but stays off the screen, so guests\n/// reading over a shoulder learn nothing. The session (scope + optional\n/// PIN) always comes from the host-only `listPartyDevices` response via\n/// [GuestCodeClient]; nothing is fabricated from build-time config.","oldString":"/// Host-visible party code panel (D-pad settings overlay page).\n///\n/// Shows the TV's own party/device code as large text, exactly one QR\n/// encoding the authoritative anonymous session payload (opaque identifiers\n/// only — never URLs, device ids, or secrets), and the joined guest device\n/// list. The session (scope + optional PIN) always comes from the host-only\n/// `listPartyDevices` response via [GuestCodeClient]; nothing is fabricated\n/// from build-time config.","path":"/private/tmp/orchestrator/cycle-12/fix-2/apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/guest_code_panel.dart"},"output":"Edited apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/guest_code_panel.dart (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/guest_code_panel.dart","patch":"Index: apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/guest_code_panel.dart\n===================================================================\n--- apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/guest_code_panel.dart\n+++ apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/guest_code_panel.dart\n@@ -1,12 +1,14 @@\n /// Host-visible party code panel (D-pad settings overlay page).\n ///\n-/// Shows the TV's own party/device code as large text, exactly one QR\n+/// Shows the party/channel session scope as text plus exactly one QR\n /// encoding the authoritative anonymous session payload (opaque identifiers\n /// only — never URLs, device ids, or secrets), and the joined guest device\n-/// list. The session (scope + optional PIN) always comes from the host-only\n-/// `listPartyDevices` response via [GuestCodeClient]; nothing is fabricated\n-/// from build-time config.\n+/// list. The TV's own device id is NEVER rendered here: it authorizes the\n+/// host-only `listPartyDevices` request but stays off the screen, so guests\n+/// reading over a shoulder learn nothing. The session (scope + optional\n+/// PIN) always comes from the host-only `listPartyDevices` response via\n+/// [GuestCodeClient]; nothing is fabricated from build-time config.\n ///\n /// Refresh: one fetch immediately on open plus a bounded periodic refresh\n /// while visible. Overlapping requests are skipped, timers are cancelled on\n /// disposal, and late responses after disposal are ignored. The last valid\n","status":"modified","additions":6,"deletions":4}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/guest_code_panel.dart (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false,"state":{"itemId":"fc_01a192c76ae17220be1da3c251bf4b62"}},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"/// Host-visible party code panel (D-pad settings overlay page).\\n///\\n/// Shows the party/channel session scope as text plus exactly one QR\\n/// encoding the authoritative anonymous session payload (opaque identifiers\\n/// only — never URLs, device ids, or secrets), and the joined guest device\\n/// list. The TV's own device id is NEVER rendered here: it authorizes the\\n/// host-only `listPartyDevices` request but st